      "text": "[3] VERIFICATION GATEWAY -- verify_batch()\na. admissibility screen (code)   -> NOT_TESTABLE\nb. DeepSeek writes falsify(frame): our library only\nc. check the code: imports, seed/N, columns*\nd. sandbox run: permutation test, HMAC-stamped\ne. Benjamini-Hochberg once, over tested claims\nf. gate: q < alpha -> effect floor -> direction\ng. one proof object per claim\nno model produces a statistic or a verdict\ndetail: pramana-gateway-flow.excalidraw\n* column check not built yet (W1)",
      "originalText": "[3] VERIFICATION GATEWAY -- verify_batch()\na. admissibility screen (code)   -> NOT_TESTABLE\nb. DeepSeek writes falsify(frame): our library only\nc. check the code: imports, seed/N, columns*\nd. sandbox run: permutation test, HMAC-stamped\ne. Benjamini-Hochberg once, over tested claims\nf. gate: q < alpha -> effect floor -> direction\ng. one proof object per claim\nno model produces a statistic or a verdict\ndetail: pramana-gateway-flow.excalidraw\n* column check not built yet (W1)",
